拉麵，鋪滿表面的炸牛蒡很吸睛，單吃也沒有油耗味，炸得酥脆感覺很適合下酒。但是牛蒡泡湯之後會恢復本來植物纖維的口感，如果先吃牛蒡的話，麵會泡得比較坨，感覺會吃得有點急。\n\n麵可以選粗細，但不能選軟硬；湯的部分碗邊會抹上一抹柚子胡椒的沾醬，調到湯裡可以適度改變風味，但店家的蒜油加進湯裡反而帶了一點苦味，個人覺得除非真的很愛蒜味，不然喝店家的原味湯底就可以，雞白湯很溫和醇厚，雖然感覺帶比較多的油脂但腥味不重。附的叉燒三片炙燒，一片做舒肥，都還滿好吃的。",null,[0,62]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3YVZremNGcE9WM0J0VmxWU2NtTnFTa1ZSZWtwSVdqQTVSMkZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3YVZremNGcE9WM0J0VmxWU2NtTnFTa1ZSZWtwSVdqQTVSMkZGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3YVZremNGcE9WM0J0VmxWU2NtTnFTa1ZSZWtwSVdqQTVSMkZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3YVZremNGcE9WM0J0VmxWU2NtTnFTa1ZSZWtwSVdqQTVSMkZGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3YVZremNGcE9WM0J0VmxWU2NtTnFTa1ZSZWtwSVdqQTVSMkZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3YVZremNGcE9WM0J0VmxWU2NtTnFTa1ZSZWtwSVdqQTVSMkZGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,10344,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwaVkzcFpOV3BtVlVScmNqSkVRekpIWjA5R2FFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x36f0421df01a7f90!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlpiY3pZNWpmVURrcjJEQzJHZ09GaEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwaVkzcFpOV3BtVlVScmNqSkVRekpIWjA5R2FFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwaVkzcFpOV3BtVlVScmNqSkVRekpIWjA5R2FFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwaVkzcFpOV3BtVlVScmNqSkVRekpIWjA5R2FFRRILMGVEMW9EdGZtZ1EaPgovQ