，但表現還是很不錯喔～南蠻炸雞更是必點，外酥內嫩，不死鹹、不重油，搭配檸檬片很解膩！每桌都有附一壺冰水🧊\n店家服務態度也很好哦～很會觀察客人的一舉一動，溝通很方便！兩個人吃得超開心，直接收進愛店名單，以後一定會再回訪！💗",null,[0,22]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTVUxdWNIWmFNMDVVWkZocmVHRnVTblZUV0ZKWVQxZHNORlZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTVUxdWNIWmFNMDVVWkZocmVHRnVTblZUV0ZKWVQxZHNORlZGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTVUxdWNIWmFNMDVVWkZocmVHRnVTblZUV0ZKWVQxZHNORlZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTVUxdWNIWmFNMDVVWkZocmVHRnVTblZUV0ZKWVQxZHNORlZGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTVUxdWNIWmFNMDVVWkZocmVHRnVTblZUV0ZKWVQxZHNORlZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5008846104871522143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTVUxdWNIWmFNMDVVWkZocmVHRnVTblZUV0ZKWVQxZHNORlZGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,11504,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMU1ucHZaM05UZFhreGFuSnVTWFJYT1dsNFVFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x36f0421df01a7f90!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlU1MnpvZ3NTdXkxanJuSXRXOWl4UEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMU1ucHZaM05UZFhreGFuSnVTWFJYT1dsNFVFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMU1ucHZaM05UZFhreGFuSnVTWFJYT1dsNFVFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMU1ucHZaM05UZFhreGFuSnVTWFJYT1dsNFVFRRILMGU4QXhIZjl3MVcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sVTFNbnB2WjNOVGRYa3hhbkp1U1hSWE9XbDRVRUUSCzBlOEF4SGY5dzFXIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARkH8a8B1C8DYqCzBlOEF4S